# Hermetic build environment — OUT-OF-TREE-GENERATED artifact (UNTRACKED).
# bin/hermetic_build generates src/generated/build_env.nim on a MISS (using the
# current git SHA as the env-hash) and restores it on a cache HIT via
# `--materialize`. Because it is gitignored, the CI purity check can be blanket
# (no scoped :! exclusion needed) — regeneration never shows up as a diff.
# This ignore line MUST stay AFTER any `!src/**/*.nim` negation so it takes
# precedence over the re-include rule configured above.
src/generated/build_env.nim

